<title>FINLAND: Baltic Ice- Ice receding, restrictions unchanged.</title>
<headline>Baltic Ice- Ice receding, restrictions unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ice levels eased but all restrictions to navigation remained in force, the Finnish Institute of Marine Research said in its twice-weekly ice report on Monday.</p>
<p>Five ice-breakers were assisting in the northern end of the Gulf of Bothnia and one in the middle, the institute said. Four ice-breakers remained in action near St Petersburg in the eastern Gulf of Finland.</p>
